# Local project history and working notes are not distribution documentation.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/BUILDING.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
/Inspector/README.md
/Inspector/*IN_GAME_TEST.md
/CompAI/README.md
/CompAI/*IN_GAME_TEST.md

